<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 4.3 points to 741.6 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 4.3 points to 741.6 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 4.3 points on Friday to 741.6 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Four of the 10 sectoral indices lost, with the energy sector losing the most, down 19.9 points to 888.4.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
